<%# Every selected file is an Attachment chip cloned from the component's
    template; preview: true gives image files a thumbnail from an object
    URL the browser releases when the chip goes, and paste: true takes a
    pasted screenshot. Drop or paste images here to see the chips. %>
<%= poetry_file_input(variant: :dropzone, name: "photos[]", multiple: true, accept: "image/*", preview: true,
                      paste: true, prompt: "Drop, paste or pick images", hint: "Each image shows a thumbnail",
                      class: "w-full max-w-md") %>
